* text=auto
*.png binary
*.jpg binary

# The G9 corpus (slice-5 B1) is BYTE-governed: fixtures/g9/corpus.json
# records a sha256 per item, lib/eval/corpus.ts re-hashes on every read, and
# `node scripts/fixtures/g9-build.mjs --check` compares exact bytes. Git's
# text=auto would CRLF-convert the PDFs, the email body and the undecodable
# fixture on a Windows checkout and every digest would miss. No conversion,
# ever — the manifest stays diffable, the material does not.
fixtures/g9/** -text
fixtures/g9/**/*.pdf binary
fixtures/g9/**/*.bin binary
